<title>DUBAI: Saudi Azizia-Panda Q1 net dips to 15.3 mln riyals.</title>
<headline>Saudi Azizia-Panda Q1 net dips to 15.3 mln riyals.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		 (million Saudi riyals unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit	     15.3	     vs    17.0</p>
<p> Turnover		196.4	     vs    163.0</p>
<p> Total assets	    1.25 billion  vs	1.16 billion</p>
<p>Full Name: Al Azizia-Panda United Inc.</p>
<p>Note: The company, which owns a string of supermarkets, is traded on the Saudi stock market. ($1=3.75 riyals) -- Dubai newsroom +9714 6071 222</p>
